  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1965699533}
  m_Text: 'Mechanics:

    In this game, you attack automatically, so do not worry.
    Focus on

    running away and trying to survive for as long as possible.

    When
    you die, you will be transported back to the therapy room

    to talk to the
    therapist about different recommendations for

    your mental health and how
    to improve it. at the end of the game

    you will fight your own poor self
    image. so be ready... prepare.'
