  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1990173576}
  m_Text: 'Lore:

    You are kendra, 14 years old. YOu have suffered from horrid
    body image for as

    long as you can remember. You have started attending therapy.
    in each therapy

    session you will fight many different representations of
    your mental health.

    As your mental health improves, you''ll see more colour
    in the world. and then

    and only then, will you finally beat your mental
    health problems

'
